  "scope": "Read-only aggregate Cloudflare analytics for complete disposable key-generation and signing campaigns using genuine OT.",
  "limits": [
    "The time window includes authentication controls and an initial signing request whose client connection failed with EHOSTUNREACH. That request has no preserved run ID.",
